      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PHOENIX AMELIA (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (35.46) at Q Parklands behind Gonzo in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Can measure up this time. HAPPY SHIRTS (2) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (30.86) at this track. Has ability and can measure up. CANYA LAUNCH (3) broke well and quickly mustered speed to win over the 550m at this track two runs back then raced on speed again when finishing second at this track last start. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Expected to be in the finish again. NANGAR POLLY (4) deserves plenty of thought at her first run at this circuit.",
